OL,3,GNEWSASidecar competitors await TT
OL,4,Aupdate
OL,5,
OL,6,FSidecar competitors say they are
OL,7,Fanxiously awaiting an Isle of Man TT
OL,8,Fupdate after new regulations prompted
OL,9,Fthree teams to pull out of the 2027
OL,10,Fevent.
OL,12,FThe future of the class has been
OL,13,Funcertain for months amid questions
OL,14,Fabout what would be required to compete
OL,15,Fon the Mountain Course next year.
OL,17,FNew rules unveiled last week, including
OL,18,Frequirements for control electronics
OL,19,Fand new engines, sparked concerns about
OL,20,Fthe cost of competing.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
